    </sect2>

      <sect2 role="installation">
        <title>Installation of Cosmic-settings-daemon</title>

    <para>Prepare Cosmic-settings-daemon for compilation:</para>

    <para>Fetch the dependencies, ensuring the exact versions recorded in the
      existing <filename>Cargo.lock</filename> file are used:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="configure">cargo fetch --locked</userinput></screen>

      <para>To Compile the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="make">cargo build --profile release --frozen</userinput></screen>

      <para>Now Install the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="install">install -vDm755 target/release/cosmic-settings-daemon \
        /usr/bin/cosmic-settings-daemon &amp;&amp;

install -vDm644 data/system_actions.ron \
  /usr/share/cosmic/com.system76.CosmicSettings.Shortcuts/v1/system_actions &amp;&amp;

install -vDm644 data/polkit-1/rules.d/cosmic-settings-daemon.rules \
  /usr/share/polkit-1/rules.d/</userinput></screen>

      </sect2>

